\description{
Permutation t tests of the coefficients of the fixed effects and permutation F (or chi-square) tests of the
terms of a model fitted by \code{aov}, \code{lm}, \code{glm}, \code{gls}, \code{lme}, \code{lmer}, \code{glmer} or
